  "portal_solution": "Before upgrading to JBoss Enterprise Web Server 2, back up your\nexisting JBoss Enterprise Web Server 1.0 RPM installation (including its\ndatabases, applications, configuration files, and so on), unsubscribe from\nthe JBEWS 1 channel and uninstall JBEWS 1 packages.\n\nRefer to\nhttps://access.redhat.com/knowledge/docs/en-US/JBoss_Enterprise_Web_Server/2.0/html/Installation_Guide/index.html for instructions on how to install and upgrade to JBoss Enterprise Web Server 2.",
  "id": "RHEA-2012:1433",
